  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would be unacceptable principle as the property is not an appropriate size to be considered suitable for conversion, would result in the loss of a family sized unit and would fail to re-provide a family sized dwelling on the ground floor, contrary Local Plan policy SC6.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, due to the lack of provision of private amenity space, would fail to provide an acceptable standard of accommodation for future occupiers, contrary to Local Plan policy SC5.",
